console.log('Database Stats:', {
  totalPatterns: stats.totalPatterns,
  dbSize: stats.dbSize,
  cacheHitRate: stats.cacheHitRate,
  avgSearchLatency: stats.avgSearchLatency,
});
```

---

## CLI Advanced Operations

### Database Import/Export

```bash
